<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs steady/up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts steady to $0.50  higher. Demand was good early but moderate to light late with some getting out of the market. Top $54.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 53.00-54.50.</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs. 43.00-45.00</p>
<p>	     500-600 lbs. 45.00-48.00</p>
<p>	     few over 600 lbs. 48.00-50 00</p>
</text>
